          "title": "Purpose",
          "content": ".. raw:: html\n\n   <div style='white-space: pre-wrap;'><div>This document specifies the Software Requirements for the SPLED system.<br/>SPLED stands for &quot;Software Product Line Engineering Demonstrator&quot;.<br/>This SPL is intended to serve as a demonstrator for the usage of the methods, tools and processes.<br/>The SPLED system is a configurable LED lighting system that supports multiple variants for different customer needs (Disco, Sleep, Spa)</div></div>",
