          "title": "Light Value Interface",
          "content": ".. raw:: html\n\n   <div style='white-space: pre-wrap;'><div>The system shall provide an RTE interface `RteSetLightValue()` to set the light color.</div></div>",
          "reqif_uuid": "_54_e13490cd-274b-4514-8b3d-544f34b79ebd",
          "sections": [
